**/resume.sh
**/resume.txt

# Host-detail files kept on disk but never published — this repo is public.
# Port maps, SELinux-confinement status, and similar reconnaissance detail live in *.local.md.
# *.local.txt covers the same rule for non-Markdown captures: the pre-upgrade `rpm -qa` package
# manifests are an exact software-and-version inventory of an internet-reachable host, which is
# the strongest reconnaissance artifact in this repo. They stay on disk and are never published.
**/*.local.md
**/*.local.txt

**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.claude
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.codex
**/.trash/
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/graph.json
**/.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json

**/*.swp
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/__pycache__/
